    <Folder>
      <name>Intelligence Summary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>AI Council Assessment</name>
        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The U.S. military continues to deploy significant forces globally, including carrier strike groups and amphibious ready groups. The Navy has successfully trialed a robotic towable capture device and interdicted suspected narco logistics and refueling stations. The Department of War has recognized suicide prevention programs and a new counter-UAS guide. The Army and National Guard emphasize their roles in the new military priorities, including the Guard&#39;s support in the Army&#39;s new priorities and a 9/11 memorial dedication. The U.S. Space Command conducted a live-fly exercise focusing on dynamic on-orbit operations and contested logistics. The DCAA Nashville Branch Office has demonstrated how modern digital tools can accelerate complex audits.</description>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>0,0,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
    </Folder>
